# Report 030 (c-1): no Speaker row on a board without a sound output. "sound hdmi": vc4-hdmi cards only (the Pi 5, the
# HackBerry; HDMI is not the board's sound, decision C2) and no sound server's sink: the root menu is the same as on the
# deck. A release build. Review only: no golden.
title settings speaker none
review
sizes 800x480 720x720 640x480
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
sound hdmi
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
wait 300
expect_rows Screen Wi-Fi Bluetooth Launcher Touch Apps Updates User "Date & Time" System
shot settings_speaker_none_root
